ion><section><ul><li><p><span>本科就读于双一流高校。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span>计算机类、设计类、机器人相关专业优先考虑。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span>具有人机交互、机器人研究经验者优先考虑。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><p><span>申请者原则上需满足以下条件：</span></p></section><section><ul><li><p><span>本科阶段前三年综合成绩排名原则上为专业前 10%。</span></p></li><li><p><span>如具有出色学术成果，排名要求可适当放宽。</span></p></li></ul></section><p><span>英语水平需达到以下条件之一：</span></p><section><ul><li><p><span>大学英语六级 460 分以上；</span></p></li><li><p><span>雅思 6 分及以上；</span></p></li><li><p><span>托福 80 分及以上。</span></p></li></ul></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><p><span>报名方式</span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请将以下材料发送至邮箱：</span><strong><span>chenlq@zju.edu.cn</span></strong></p><section><ul><li><p><span>本科成绩单；</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语水平证明；</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人简历；</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他附加材料。（包括论文、项目介绍、作品集、竞赛获奖证明、科研经历说明等能够体现个人能力与研究潜力的材料）</span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><span>直博推免生</span>也可同时申请浙江大学人工智能学院官方夏令营。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><p><span>报名截止日期</span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>报名截止日期为：</span></p><section><p><strong><span>2026 年 7 月 5 日</span></strong></p><section><p><span>请有意向的同学尽早准备材料并完成报名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><p><span>夏令营安排</span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营活动预计持续 2 周左右。对于非保研的科研实习生，建议参与时间为 1 个月以上，以便更充分地参与项目训练与科研协作。</span></p><p><span>活动将采用线上与线下结合的形式开展。</span><span><span>线上部分将以科研项目协作为主，帮助同学们提前熟悉真实科研问题，了解研究流程与项目推进方式。</span></span><span><span>线下活动包括实验室参观、学术讲座、workshop、技能培训等内容，帮助同学们更系统地了解研究环境、团队方向与科研方法。</span></span><span><span>活动预计于 7 月底至 8 月初进行，具体时间将另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span>END</span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><strong><span>公众号</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>智能创意与交互实验室 ICI Lab</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>实验室官网</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>https://icilab.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>陈柳青研究员网站</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>https://person.zju.edu.cn/chenlq</span></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d5182d6f5145a5046f7